<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Trading fairly active. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    56.00-56.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.50 lower; 450-650 lbs steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.75-46.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	    500-600 lbs    48.00-48.50</p>
<p>	    600-650 lbs    49.00</p>
</text>
